## DeepResearch Bench

`src/katala_research/bench/tasks/drb-subset-5.json` is a five-task smoke subset
adapted from DeepResearch Bench. Task prompts were rewritten and mixed with
domain-specific queries; it is not the published benchmark and must not be
reported as a DRB score.

- Source: https://deepresearch-bench.github.io/
- Use: adapted task descriptions only

